        "type": "writing",
        "title": "The chart below shows the percentage of adults of different age groups in the UK who used the Internet every day from 2003–2006. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<p><em><strong><strong id=\"docs-internal-guid-9b5d24e8-7fff-31a8-e4f1-df7585bc5c63\">The chart below shows the percentage of adults of different age groups in the UK who used the Internet every day from 2003&ndash;2006</strong>. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></p>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Daily Internet Use in UK: 2003&ndash;2006</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CLFOdaXQXo81HuxXYt4lD4hSgmh\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i Daily Internet Use in UK: 2003&ndash;2006 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về tỷ lệ người lớn ở c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m tuổi kh&aacute;c ở UK nhau sử dụng Internet trong giai đoạn bốn năm từ 2003 đến 2006.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O3LtdQTfLo1VDvxozLglWV05gXe\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn n&ecirc;n học c&aacute;ch <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuong-doi\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">tả số liệu 'tương đối' &amp; paraphrase cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</a></strong></span> trước khi viết b&agrave;i &rarr;<strong> </strong>đ&acirc;y l&agrave; kỹ năng viết v&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan trọng để d&ugrave;ng trong cả b&agrave;i viết.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D0sBdb1v0oQluNxDMd0lveIvgdb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Daily Internet Use in UK: 2003&ndash;2006 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: người lớn ở c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m tuổi kh&aacute;c nhau ở UK - sử dụng Internet - từ 2003 đến 2006.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UPj4do33VoENw1x1AjelxPjzgjg\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VALoduKnyoOdBHx2DePlop3ggSf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề thay đổi theo thời gian, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ đề cập đến 2 th&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DV8tdmnyooYRkKxCt6ElDnD4gMd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Trends: </strong>Tất cả c&aacute;c nh&oacute;m tuổi đều c&oacute; xu hướng tăng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOtfdhUJuoeJfrx9kuSlT6fngoc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Differences: </strong>nh&oacute;m trẻ tuổi nhất c&oacute; tỷ lệ sử dụng Internet cao nhất, c&ograve;n nh&oacute;m cao tuổi nhất th&igrave; c&oacute; phần trăm thấp hơn đ&aacute;ng kể trong suốt thời kỳ.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IFf1dMjRDok8HtxlXSUlI37OgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kd5JdEBw0oISfhxnssflqArQg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CYn3dLpEtoSTrkx5OYtlCWEogxb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> 16-24, 25-44 v&agrave; 45-54</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G3pWdf2fEoU9wmxEOmhlG9vLgFf\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XcRBdwHOyocD0OxGo45lXsUOgOh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2003 </strong><em>(nh&oacute;m 16-24 ghi nhận khoảng 80%, cao hơn đ&aacute;ng kể so với nh&oacute;m 25-44 (50%) v&agrave; 45-54 (60%)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L2YGd5Ig8oZ8W6xpdZql67dogph\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m 16-24 </strong><em>(tăng l&ecirc;n 100% v&agrave;o năm 2005, sau đ&oacute; giảm nhẹ xuống c&ograve;n 90% v&agrave;o năm 2006).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FBD9doF9noIjIAxND89lR4q7gBd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m 25-44 v&agrave; 45-54 </strong><em>(tăng đều đặn hơn, c&ugrave;ng đạt khoảng 80% v&agrave;o năm 2006)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QBRFd178ModSdaxGuH5lOHkwgzk\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ne0hdOtXYo0WV9xBE3vlfGvmgge\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2:</strong><strong> 55-64 v&agrave; 65+</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SLP6dhVD5oiCoLxKUV9lOeZzgMd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Muv8dOf6aoeelexCFVxlHYeMgBh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh số liệu năm 2003 </strong><em>(nh&oacute;m 55-64 ghi nhận khoảng 30%, v&agrave; nh&oacute;m 65+ ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n kh&ocirc;ng sử dụng Internet mỗi ng&agrave;y)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WrDidNXJEoBtO0xewjwlzZZrgrf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m 55-64 </strong><em>(tăng l&ecirc;n khoảng 50% v&agrave;o năm 2006).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D0uidwFY5oDIIkxhJXxlh2BsgBf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) <strong>M&ocirc; tả</strong> <strong>xu hướng của nh&oacute;m 65+ </strong><em>(tăng l&ecirc;n 20% v&agrave;o năm 2006)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YcKgd2ZQhoZ6q3xBXhJl7Hbvg2e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FIeOdbZuAoSdUExbJcclWMbVg8c\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"người ở độ tuổi 16-24<strong>\"</strong>, m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể sử dụng c&aacute;c c&aacute;ch diễn đạt sau để đa dạng c&acirc;u từ hơn nh&eacute;!</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mst7dJM5AobQt1x2p82l8qz8gjh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Individuals aged 16-24</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NCjTdh7blouUdhxst3uleSRkgud\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>The 16-24 age group</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CLjad7X6VocFbXxumXOlvmSIgGd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>The youngest age group/ demographic/ cohort (nếu trong biểu đồ l&agrave; độ tuổi nhỏ nhất)</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XeaSdeSlgoHTyqxdmwgl369qgEh\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ:</strong></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AcDldSjXnosODuxe0i5lumxBgcc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Approximately 80% of <strong>individuals aged 16-24</strong> were Internet users in 2003.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FAnadl3NKoVrJpx62OgltPeZgKc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>The youngest demographic (16-24 years)</strong> consistently maintained the highest rates of Internet use</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 926,
